A lime logo that looks like the Greek letter Beta (β) that represents the Radii-created social network [Beta](https://beta.radii-office.com). It can be used in any way as Beta is not a trademark of Radii (any Radii trademarks or trade dress are waived away/not enforced) and because the license is CC0!
